* servo_detect_typ

* SS54 Schottky, 5 A (approx.: ~0.37 V at 0.8 A, ~0.47 V at 4 A)
.model SS54 D(Is=1e-5 N=1.05 Rs=0.025 Cjo=300p)
* 0603 LEDs: InGaN green (~2.6 V @ 1 mA) and AlInGaP yellow-green / yellow (~1.9 V @ 1 mA)
.model LED_GREEN_INGAN D(Is=1e-22 N=2.2 Rs=10)
.model LED_YG D(Is=1e-18 N=2.0 Rs=8)
* open-collector output stage of one LM339 unit: switch on when V(-) > V(+) + offset
.model OC SW(Vt=0 Vh=0.0001 Ron=40 Roff=1e9)


V1 3v3 0 3.3
Iload 0 sense 0
Rs sense 0 10
Dc sense 0 SS54
Rr1 3v3 vref 330000.0
Rr2 vref 0 1000.0
S_k2 k2 0 sense cmp_k2 OC
V_os_k2 cmp_k2 vref 0.0

Rled 3v3 a 1k
Dled a k LED_YG
Vm k k2 0

.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
dc Iload 0 4.5 0.000225
wrdata /home/user/master-s-thesis/hardware/pcb/segment_board/sim/results/servo_detect_typ.dat v(sense) i(Vm)
quit
.endc
.end
